        "toolDescription": "Returns the user's last 30 days of events (type, timestamp, tender_id), newest first, max 30. Input: user_id.",
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT event_type, occurred_at, tender_id FROM events WHERE user_id = $1::uuid AND occurred_at > now() - interval '30 days' ORDER BY occurred_at DESC LIMIT 30;",
